<view class="page body-state-page {{uiThemeClass}}" bindtap="closeBodyRangeMenu">
 <view class="body-heading"><text class="page-title">身体状态</text><text class="page-sub">从每一次记录，了解身体近况。</text></view>
 <text class="sheet-error" wx:if="{{formError}}">{{formError}}</text>
 <view class="summary-card health-card"><view class="health-top"><view><text class="section-title">健康分</text><view class="score-number-row"><text wx:if="{{healthScore.ready}}" class="health-number">{{healthScore.text}}</text><view wx:else class="health-number health-empty" aria-label="暂无法计算"><view></view><view></view></view><text class="score-unit" wx:if="{{healthScore.ready}}">/ 100</text></view><text class="score-status">{{healthScore.ready ? healthScore.subtitle : '暂无法计算'}}</text></view><image class="health-mascot" src="/assets/mascot/balanced-0.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="score-track"><view wx:if="{{healthScore.ready}}" class="score-fill" style="width:{{healthScore.value}}%;"></view></view><view class="score-ticks"><text>0</text><text>50</text><text>100</text></view><text class="body-note" wx:if="{{healthScore.reason}}">{{healthScore.reason}}</text><text class="score-disclaimer">基于BMI与腰高比的体型参考，产品自定义评分，不用于诊断。</text></view>
 <view class="height-card"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">当前身体数据</text><text class="section-caption">各项独立更新</text></view><view class="weight-current"><view><text class="metric-caption">最新体重</text><view class="weight-number-row"><text class="weight-number">{{weightText}}</text><text class="metric-unit">{{weightUnit}}</text></view></view><text class="body-date weight-source">{{weightDate}}</text></view><view class="measurement-grid"><view><text class="metric-caption">身高</text><text class="measurement-value">{{heightText}}</text><text class="body-date">{{heightDate}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-caption">腰围</text><text class="measurement-value">{{waistText}}</text><text class="body-date">{{waistDate}}</text></view><view><text class="metric-caption">臀围</text><text class="measurement-value">{{hipText}}</text><text class="body-date">{{hipDate}}</text></view></view></view>
 <view class="height-card"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">体型指标</text><text class="section-caption">成人参考</text></view><view class="indicator" wx:for="{{bodyIndicators}}" wx:key="key"><view class="indicator-head"><text>{{item.label}}</text><view><text class="indicator-number {{item.tone}}">{{item.text}}</text><text class="metric-unit">{{item.unit}}</text></view></view><view class="reference-scale {{item.key}}-scale"><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view wx:if="{{item.position !== null}}" class="scale-marker" style="left:{{item.position}}%;"></view></view><view class="scale-labels" wx:if="{{item.key === 'bmi'}}"><text>偏瘦</text><text>适宜</text><text>偏高</text><text>较高</text></view><view class="scale-labels" wx:else><text>＜0.40</text><text>0.40–＜0.50</text><text>0.50–＜0.60</text><text>≥0.60</text></view><text class="body-date">{{item.reference}}</text><text class="body-date">{{item.source}} · {{item.date}}</text></view><text class="body-note">标尺仅作区间示意。指标可能来自不同日期，不代表身体成分或医学诊断。</text></view>
 <view class="height-card"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">身体变化</text><view class="body-period-controls"><view class="range-tabs"><view class="{{bodyRange === 'week' ? 'range-active' : ''}}" data-range="week" bindtap="handleBodyRange">周</view><view class="{{bodyRange === 'month' ? 'range-active' : ''}}" data-range="month" bindtap="handleBodyRange">月</view><view class="{{bodyRange === 'year' ? 'range-active' : ''}}" data-range="year" bindtap="handleBodyRange">年</view></view>
 <view class="body-period-selector"><view class="body-period-trigger {{bodyRange === 'custom' ? 'range-active' : ''}}" catchtap="toggleBodyRangeMenu" aria-role="button" aria-label="选择日期"><text>选择日期</text><text class="body-period-caret">{{bodyRangeMenuOpen ? '▴' : '▾'}}</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{bodyRangeMenuOpen}}" class="body-period-menu body-period-custom" catchtap="keepBodyRangeMenu"><view class="body-custom-range"><view class="custom-range-dates"><picker mode="date" value="{{customStart}}" end="{{dateLimit}}" data-field="customStart" bindchange="handleCustomDate"><view>{{customStart}} ▾</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{customEnd}}" end="{{dateLimit}}" data-field="customEnd" bindchange="handleCustomDate"><view>{{customEnd}} ▾</view></picker></view><button size="mini" bindtap="applyCustomRange">确定</button><text class="range-error" wx:if="{{rangeError}}">{{rangeError}}</text></view></view></view></view></view>
 <view class="body-trend-tabs"><view class="{{bodyChart.metric === 'kg' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-metric="kg" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">体重</view><view class="{{bodyChart.metric === 'waistCm' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-metric="waistCm" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">腰围</view><view class="{{bodyChart.metric === 'hipCm' ? 'body-trend-active' : ''}}" data-metric="hipCm" bindtap="handleBodyMetric">臀围</view></view>
 <block wx:if="{{bodyChart.hasData}}"><view class="trend-summary"><text>{{bodyChart.latestText}} {{bodyChart.unit}}</text><text>{{bodyChart.changeText}} {{bodyChart.points.length > 1 ? bodyChart.unit : ''}}</text></view><view class="plot-meta"><text>{{bodyChart.label}} · {{bodyChart.unit}}</text><text>{{bodyChart.minText}}–{{bodyChart.maxText}}</text></view><view class="weight-plot"><view class="plot-grid grid-top"></view><view class="plot-grid grid-middle"></view><view class="plot-grid grid-bottom"></view><view wx:if="{{bodyChart.hasLine}}" class="weight-lines"><view class="weight-segment" wx:for="{{bodyChart.segments}}" wx:key="key" style="left:{{item.left}}%;top:{{item.top}}%;width:{{item.width}}%;transform:rotate({{item.angle}}deg);"></view></view><view class="weight-dot" wx:for="{{bodyChart.points}}" wx:key="key" style="left:{{item.x}}%;top:{{item.y}}%;" aria-label="{{item.date}}，{{item.text}}"><text wx:if="{{bodyChart.points.length === 1}}">{{item.text}}</text></view></view><view class="weight-range"><text>{{bodyChart.startDate}}</text><text>{{bodyChart.endDate}}</text></view><text class="body-note" wx:if="{{bodyChart.points.length === 1}}">仅有一次测量，暂不连线展示变化。</text></block>
 <view class="chart-empty" wx:else><view class="empty-chart"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view><text>这段时间暂无{{bodyChart.label || '体重'}}记录</text><text class="body-date">其他页面保存的测量数据将在此同步展示。</text></view><text class="body-note">{{bodyChart.note}}</text><text class="body-note">缺失不补零；折线连接测量点。体重或围度下降不等于健康改善。</text><view class="trend-link" bindtap="openTrends" aria-role="button"><text>查看详细趋势</text><text>›</text></view></view>
 <view class="height-card"><view class="section-head sources-trigger" bindtap="toggleSources" aria-role="button"><text class="section-title">数据与计算依据</text><text class="source-toggle">{{sourcesOpen ? '收起 ▴' : '展开 ▾'}}</text></view><text class="body-note">本页仅展示身体状态，数据随其他页面已保存的身体资料更新。</text><view class="source-body" wx:if="{{sourcesOpen}}"><text class="body-note">BMI = 体重(kg) ÷ 身高(m)²；腰高比 = 腰围 ÷ 身高。</text><text class="body-note">健康分采用产品自定义100 / 70 / 40分档，两项取较低分；BMI参考分 {{healthScore.bmiScoreText}}，腰高比参考分 {{healthScore.ratioScoreText}}。</text><text class="body-note">BMI参考分：18.5≤BMI＜24为100，偏瘦或24≤BMI＜28为70，BMI≥28为40。腰高比：0.4≤比值＜0.5为100，0.5≤比值＜0.6为70，比值≥0.6为40。</text><text class="body-note">体重与腰围需有近30天的测量日期；BMI≥35或腰高比＜0.4时暂停综合评分。30天为产品更新要求，不是医学有效期。</text><text class="body-note">{{healthScore.reason}}</text><text class="body-note">{{healthScore.disclaimer}}</text><text class="body-note">规则版本：{{healthScore.ruleVersion}}</text></view></view><text class="page-footnote">记录帮助观察变化，健康分不能代替体检或专业评估。</text>
</view>
